### 학생 등록 (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "이영희",
  "studentNumber": "20240003"
}

### 예시 학생 자동 등록 (POST 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/students/sample

### 학생 정보 전체 수정 (PUT 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길순",
  "studentNumber": "20249999"
}

### 학생 이름만 수정 (PUT 2)
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "홍민지"
}

### 특정 학생 삭제 (DELETE 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/1

### 전체 학생 삭제 (DELETE 2)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students

### 400 Bad Request 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "studentNumber": ""
}

### 404 Not Found 테스트
GET http://localhost:8080/students/999

### 500 Internal Server Error 테스트
GET http://localhost:8080/students?error=500

### 503 Service Unavailable 테스트
GET http://localhost:8080/students?error=503

### JSON 형식 오류 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길동",
  "studentNumber":
}
